---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Premises" path="/premises">
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="title">Premises</h1>
    <p>KiMuPe seeks to develop the inner musician<br />by integrating movement<br />to realise the incorporation of the musical instrument.</p>
    <p class="gap">The premises of the approach are:</p>
    <ul class="bullets gap">
      <li>always involving the musical instrument</li>
      <li>developing the inner musician through a process of interiorisation</li>
      <li>bottom up approach: exploring and experimenting</li>
      <li>gradually from simple to complex</li>
      <li>exercise the performing body</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
